1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Hey everyone, have you ever stopped to think about what your body parts are doing right now? Like, your heart is beating around 100,000 times per day, pumping blood throughout your body

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Your lungs are breathing in and out, taking in oxygen and releasing carbon dioxide

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
And your brain is processing all the information around you, helping you to think, learn, and remember

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
But that's not all, your nose can detect over 1 trillion different scents, and your eyes can process 36,000 bits of information every hour

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
It's crazy to think about, but our bodies are capable of some pretty amazing things

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
So, next time you're sitting around, just remember, your body is hard at work, even when you're not

